nputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 28, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "TTP", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "可选连接", "type": "*"}], "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [333.67315673828125, 85.41754150390625], "color": "#432", "pos": [959.2946166992188, 611.5056762695312], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 34, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "SeedVR2.5图像修复", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [{"name": "tile_width", "slot_index": 0, "links": [27], "label": "tile_width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "tile_width"}, {"name": "tile_height", "slot_index": 1, "links": [28], "label": "tile_height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "tile_height"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [3, 4, 0.1], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 35, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "width_factor"}, "name": "width_factor", "label": "width_factor", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width_factor"}, {"widget": {"name": "height_factor"}, "name": "height_factor", "label": "height_factor", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height_factor"}, {"widget": {"name": "overlap_rate"}, "name": "overlap_rate", "label": "overlap_rate", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "overlap_rate"}], "flags": {}, "type": "TTP_Tile_image_size", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [210, 126], "pos": [1842.776123046875, 2484.802978515625], "id": 31, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_ttp_toolset", "ver": "1.0.5", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "TTP_Tile_image_size"}, "order": 24}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# SeedVR2 Video Upscaler (v2.5.15) 参数详解\n\n# 作者：老许爱吃肉丶\n\n## 一、核心输入参数\n- **image** — 输入待放大的视频帧序列（图像批次）\n- **dit** — DiT（Diffusion Transformer）模型，用于扩散去噪过程\n- **vae** — VAE 编码器/解码器，用于图像与潜空间的转换\n\n---\n\n## 二、生成控制参数\n- **seed** — 随机种子，控制生成过程的随机性（默认：`476473713`）\n- **control_after_generate** — 生成后种子处理方式\n  - `randomize` — 随机化（默认）\n  - `fixed` — 固定\n  - `increment` — 递增\n\n---\n\n## 三、分辨率控制\n- **resolution** — 目标输出分辨率，短边长度（默认：`2048`）\n- **max_resolution** — 最大允许分辨率限制，防止显存溢出（默认：`4096`）\n\n---\n\n## 四、批次处理参数\n- **batch_size** — 每批处理的帧数，影响显存占用和速度（默认：`5`）\n- **uniform_batch_size** — 是否强制统一批次大小（默认：`false`）\n\n---\n\n## 五、色彩校正（color_correction）\n\n### 功能说明\n- 修正放大过程中的色彩偏移，使输出匹配原始输入色彩\n\n### 可选模式\n- **lab** — 感知色彩匹配，保留细节（**推荐，默认**）\n- **wavelet** — 基于频率的自然色彩，保留精细细节\n- **wavelet_adaptive** — 小波基底 + 针对性饱和度校正\n- **hsv** — 基于色相的条件饱和度匹配\n- **adain** — 统计风格迁移方法\n- **none** — 不应用色彩校正\n\n---\n\n## 六、时序处理参数\n- **temporal_overlap** — 帧间时序重叠数量，提升连贯性但增加计算量（默认：`0`）\n- **prepend_frames** — 序列前填充帧数，处理首帧时序上下文（默认：`0`）\n\n---\n\n## 七、噪声控制参数\n- **input_noise_scale** — 输入图像噪声缩放，增加可提升细节（默认：`0.000`）\n- **latent_noise_scale** — 潜空间噪声缩放，控制扩散随机性（默认：`0.000`）\n\n---\n\n## 八、系统优化参数\n- **offload_device** — 模型卸载设备\n  - `cpu` — 内存充足时使用（默认）\n  - `gpu` — 显存充足时使用\n- **enable_debug** — 启用调试模式，输出详细日志（默认：`false`）\n\n---\n\n## 九、使用建议\n\n### 显存配置\n- **显存充足（24GB+）** — `offload_device: gpu`，适当提高 `batch_size`\n- **显存有限（8-12GB）** — `offload_device: cpu`，降低 `batch_size` 到 2-3\n\n### 色彩需求\n- **追求色彩还原** — `lab`（默认）或 `wavelet`\n- **艺术风格迁移** — `adain`\n\n### 其他场景\n- **快速测试** — 降低 `resolution` 和 `max_resolution`\n- **长视频处理** — 增加 `temporal_overlap` 保证连贯性"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [725.0248413085938, 1510.68603515625], "pos": [165.91159057617188, 601.69482421875], "id": 35, "properties": {}, "order": 13}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.